  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. The main ticket is PowerToys#20306, \"Quick Accent: show toolbar close to text cursor\". PowerToys#24627 and PowerToys#28505 were closed as duplicates of it. Quick Accent can currently only show its toolbar at one of nine fixed screen positions, and none of the tickets mention a workaround. In Settings > Quick Accent, you can pick the fixed position that is closest to where you usually type. To support the request, add a 👍 or a comment on #20306. One commenter suggested a toggle or dropdown, so people who prefer a fixed position can keep it."
